<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">-Kamano-Kafe</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Tesalonaika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Poli'a Tesalonaika Mono Vahe'mokizmi Anante Avonkrezmi'nea Naneke</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ramofo knama henka fore hania zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Hagi nagra Poli'nagi Sailasi'ene Timotigata Tesalonaika mani'naza mono nagamota Anumza Nafatine, Ranti Jisas Kraisinte tragotetma mani'nazamotarega, ama avona kre'neramunankino, <verse eid="2TH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Anumza Nafatimofone, Ranti Jisas Kraisi Asunku'zamo'ene rimpa fruzamo'a tamagrane mesie.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tesalonaika vahe'mo'za zamentintifina oti hanaveti'naza zanku Poli'a susu huzmante'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Hagi nenfugata maka knama tamagriku'ma tagesa nentahita Anumzamofona susu hunentona zamo'a, e'i knare'zantfa hu'ne. Na'ankure tamagri tamentintimo'a rura huno nevigetma, magoke magokemotma ovesinte avesintema nehaza zamo'a hageno ra nehie. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>E'ina hu'negu, tamentinti nehutma, maka tamazeri havizama nehazafine, knazama tamizafima kazikazi hutama neaza zankura, Anumzamofo mono nagamofo amu'nompina tamagri tamagenkema nezamasamita, tamagrikura husaga huneramante'na akaginerone.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>E'i ana maka'zamo'a Anumzamo'a fatgo refko zama'a erifore nehiankino, e'inahukna tamatazama e'neriza zampi Anumzamo'a tamazeri retro nehina, Anumzamofo kumara erigahaze. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Na'ankure Anumzamo'a fatgo zanke nehia Nekino, tamazeri havizama nehaza vahera, nona'a huno zamazeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Hianagi Ramo Jisasi'ma monafintima hanavenentake ankero vahe'anema, teve anefa'ane eama hanuno'a, Agra kanazampintira tamazeri o'za nehuno, tagri'enena knazantifintira eme tazeri o'za hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Hanki Anumzamofoma ke'za antahiza nosuza, Ranti Jisas Kraisi Knare Kusenkema novaririza vahera, nona'a huno knazana eme zamigahie. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Ama ana vahe'mo'za havi mizazami e'neriza, Ramofonteti'ene hanavenentake masa'afintira atre'za afete'are mani'ne'za, zamata erivava hugahaze. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Anazama fore'ma haniana Ramoma ete esianknarera Agri vahe'ma mani'naza vahe'mo'zama ra agima nemisafina, tamagranena ana vahe amu'nompi maninetma, ra agi amigahaze. Na'ankure tagrama Agriku'ma huama hu'na kerera, tamagra tamentinti hu'naze.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Poli'a Tesalonaika mono vahe'mo'za hankaveti'za manisnagu Anumzamofo antahige'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Hagi Anumzamo huhampri tamantenegeta tamagrikura nunamuna huneramantonankino, Anumzamo'a tamazeri knare hina, Agri vahe manigahaze. Tagra nunamuna huvava nehunankino, Anumzamofo hanavemo'a tamaza nehina, maka knare'zama hunaku'ma nehaza zana nehuta, tamamentinti hutma hugahunema nehazazana hugahaze. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>E'inahuma hanutma Ramofo Jisas Kraisi Agi erihentesga nehnageno, Anumzantine Ranti Jisas Kraisi'enena asunkuzama'areti tamagi erisaga hugahie.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kasege rutagre ne'mofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Hagi nerefugata Ranti Jisas Kraisi'ma esigeta, Agranema tagrama ome atru hanuna zamofonkura, menina anage huta tagra tamantahinegone. <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Mago'a vahe'mo'za tamasamiza Ramofo kna hago fore hu'ne hu'za tamasamisazo, mago vahe'mo huno Ruotge Avamumo e'inahu kasnampa kea nasamie huge, mago ke huama nehuno hanio, mago vahe'mo huno, e'inahukna avona hamprita keteta huama hunema hanageta, e'inahu kema antahisutma, antri nehutma ame hutma antahintahi tamifina antahigna osiho. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Atrenkeno mago kampintira vahe'mo'za reramatga osiho. Na'ankure ana kna fore osu'nenigeno, kote'zana rama'a vahe'mo'za Anumzamofona zamefi humitesageno, kasegema rutagre ne'mo'a efore nehina, ana ne'mofona azeri haviza hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Ana ne'mo'a agra'a maka'zama anumzane hu'za mono hunentaza'zane, mago'a mono hunentaza zantamina ha'renezmanteno, Nagra ra mani'noe huno Anumzamofo ra mono nompi trate nemanino, agra'a azeri ama huno Anumza mani'noe huno hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Tamagra ontahi'nazo, koma tamagranema mani'nena e'inahu vahera fore hugahie hu'na tamasaminoana? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Hagi menina nazamo kana rehiza hunte'ne, tamagra antahi'naze, e'ina hu'neankino agra'a kna fatgore ana ne'mo'a eama hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Na'ankure kasegema rutagre hanavemo'a oku'a erizana ko e'neriankino, ana kama rehiza hu'nemofona azeri kami atretenkeno, kasegema rutagre ne'mo'a eama hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Anantera kasegema rutagre ne'mo'a eama hanigeno, Jisas'a agipinti zahonu huharafu huno ahenefrino, Agrama esia hihamu masa'amo, ana nera ahefri vagaregahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Anama hania ne'mo'a, Sata hanavereti hanavenentakezane, kaguvazane, havige avame'za erifore nehanigeno, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Anumzamo'a zamagu'ma vazisigu'ma tamage kema zami'neana, zamagra zamentintia osu atre'nazagu, Agra mika havige avu'ava zante'ma fananema hu kante'ma nevaza vahera rezamatga hugahie. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Na'ankure e'ina agafare Anumzamo'a antahintahizamia zamazeri savari hinke'za, havige zante zmentintia nehu'za, <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>tamage kerera zamentinti nosu'za, havi avu'avazama hu'zanku muse nehazankino, ana miko'mokizimia refko huzamanteno knazana zamigahie.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oti hanaveti zamofo naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Hianagi tamagriku huta maka kna tagra Anumzamofona susu huntegahune. Ramo'ma avesi'neramantea nenafugata ese agafare Anumzamo'a tamagu'vazinaku huhampri' ramante'neankino, Avamuteti'ene tamage kerema tamentintima nehazageno, tamazeri ruotge hu'ne. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Tagrama Knare Musenkema huama hunazampi, Anumzamo'a tamavare kana retro higetma, Ranti Jisas Kraisi hihamu masazama'a e'nerize. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Ana hu'negu nenafugata avoma kreneramita, rempima hurami'nona kerera azeri hanavetita oti hanavetiho. <verse eid="2TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Menina Ranti Jisas Kraisine, Anumza Nafatimo, avesinerante'mo asunku mani vava mani'zane, knare amuhazane asunkuzama'areti neramino, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>tamazeri so'e nehuno, kema hanazano, maka knare eri'zama erisazana, tamagu'a tamazeri hanavetigahie.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Poli'a nunamu huntesazegu Tesalonaika mono vahe zamantahige'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Hanki huvagare nanekea, nenfugata nunamu hunerantenkeno, tamagripima hu'neazana huno Ramofo nanekemo'a, maka kokantega ame huno vuno e'no nehina, ragi amiho. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Ana nehanageno, tagrira fatgo osu vahe'ene havi vahepintira tahokeno tavregahie. Na'ankure zamagra maka'mo'za zamentinti osu vahe mani'naze. <verse eid="2TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Hianagi Ramo'a hugahuema haniaza hu'nekino, havi avu'avazama nehia ne'mo'ma tamazeri haviza huzankura kegava huramantegahie. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Tagra, tamagrikura hugahaze huta Ramofompina antahineramunankita, tamagrama nehazazana mago'ene nehutma, hihoma hutama huramante'nonazana hugahaze. <verse eid="2TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Ramo'a tamagrira Anumzamofo avesizana tamagu'afina eriama nehina, Kraisi'ma hu'neaza hutma kazigazi hutma vugahaze.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Hagi menina nenafugata anage huta hanave kea neramasamune, Ranti Jisas Kraisi agifina, eri'zama eri naneke rempima hunezamunke'za novariri'za, feru nemaniza tafuhe'ina zmatretma ogantu maniho. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Na'ankure tamagra antahinaze, tagrama rempima hurami'nona avu'avazamofo negetma avaririho. Na'ankure tagra amu'nontamifima tavesrama osu, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>magomofo bretia amanea erita o'nenonanki mizaseta neneta, tamagrima knama tamizankura maraguzatita hanine zagenena erizana e'nerune. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Hianagi tagra mago'a neza taminageta e'rinakura nosunanagi, tagra knare tavutavama huza tamaveri hanunketma, tamagra ana tavu'tavaza avaririhogu anara nehune. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Na'ankure tamagranema manineta, amanahu avu'avaza hugahaze huta hanave kea tamasami'none. Mago vahe'mo'ma eri'zama e'orinakuma hania vahe'mo'a, ne'zana onegahie. <verse eid="2TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Na'ankure tagrama antahunana amu'nontamifina mago'amo'za erizana e'noriza, vahe'mofo zanku zamagenke nehu'za, eri'za e'ori feru vahe nemanize. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Menina e'inahu vahe'mofona, Ramofo Jisas Kraisimpina hanavege huta zamazeri hanave'netita, akohe'za mani'ne'za zamagrazmi zamazampinti erizana eri'za, nomanizazmia retro hu'za maniho huta nehune. <verse eid="2TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Hianagi tamagra nerafugata, knare tamavu'tmavama huzankura tamavesra osino huta nehune. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Iza'o ama avompima kre'nona kemofoma amagema ontesimofona, anamofona keni hunetama, agranena tragoteta omaninkeno agra agazegu hino. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Hugahianagi, ha vahetamignara anamofona huonteho, hianagi nerafuga haviza hunane hutma azeri fatgo hiho.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Poli'a huvagare ke hu'nea naneke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Menina rimpa fru Ramo, Agra'a maka knama hakare'zama hanafina, tamarimpa frua tamigahie. Ramo'a makamotane manisie. <verse eid="2TH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Nagra'a Polina ama musenkea nazanko avona nentena, e'inahukna hu'na krenoankita kegahaze. <verse eid="2TH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Rantimofo Jisas Kraisi asunkuzamo'a makamotma tamagrane mesie.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
